  "historyNote": "#2205, eff 12-12-82; ss by #2504, eff 10-12-83; ss by #3181, eff 1-22-86; ss by #4061, eff 5-29-86; ss by #5399, eff 5-21-92; ss and moved by #6750, eff 5-19-98 (from Rev 703.04); ss by #8653, eff 6-8-06; ss by #10714, eff 11-7-14; ss by #14105, eff 10-29-24, EXPIRES: 10-29-34",
